completed_at: "2026-08-18T06:45:47.178Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 720
acceptance_criteria: "The contracts table declares each command's positional signature as data - slot name, required or optional, value kind, and whether the slot is polymorphic - alongside the flag and exit-code declarations it already carries; A conformance gate fails when a command's declared positional arity disagrees with its enforced arity, with pm schema, pm profile, and pm plan as the negative-control fixtures that fail before the fix; One concept has one positional spelling and one arity across the surface: the item id is required or optional by a declared rule, not per command, and a violation fails the gate; Omitting a required positional produces the missing-required-argument refusal on every command, never the invalid-value refusal, asserted across the full command inventory; The count of distinct positional shapes is measured, recorded as evidence on this item, declared as a budget in the contracts table, and cannot increase without the gate failing; Subcommand dispatch converges on one declared shape, with every current spelling preserved as a hidden alias proven by a test over the pre-change inventory"
goal: project management = context management
objective: "Bring positional arguments under the same declared-and-gated grammar that already governs flags, nouns, verbs, exit codes, and error codes"
value: An agent that cannot generalize argument placement must carry a per-command mental model; closing the last ungoverned grammar layer is what makes the noun-verb consolidation actually reduce what an agent has to know
why_now: "The simplification epic is measured in nouns and flags, but the positional layer is where the surface silently disagrees with its own help text, and it is the one layer with no owner among the four grammar-governance items"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: high
environment: "pm 2026.8.2, 76 rendered top-level commands, linux"
resolution: "All 158 executable destinations now have public typed positional signatures and a conformance gate enforcing required, variadic, value-kind, polymorphism, and a 21-shape budget."
expected_result: "A rendered [subcommand] slot is omittable on every command that renders it, and a required slot refuses with the missing-required-argument code everywhere"
actual_result: "pm schema, pm profile, and pm plan render [subcommand] and exit 2 with Invalid argument value when it is omitted, while graph and merge render <subcommand> and exit 2 with Missing required argument subcommand"
